WEBVTT

00:17.330 --> 00:18.830
GHOST BUSTERZ!

00:17.710 --> 00:20.460
OH! The time has come

00:18.250 --> 00:18.830
BUSTERZ!

00:20.460 --> 00:23.840
To stand up for tomorrow

00:22.790 --> 00:24.250
OH OH OH!

00:23.840 --> 00:26.420
We're ghostbusterz

00:26.420 --> 00:31.050
Breakin' away from the old ghosts

00:31.050 --> 00:34.430
Of history

00:34.430 --> 00:37.810
Breaking free!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!

01:13.300 --> 01:17.100
No fear for anything in our way!

01:15.640 --> 01:20.440
Presented by Strelizia subs

01:17.100 --> 01:18.640
The time has come

01:32.820 --> 01:37.040
The seventh month of 1600 AD, or Keicho 5.

01:37.410 --> 01:41.210
Charging Tokugawa Ieyasu with thirteen articles of impeachment,

01:41.210 --> 01:48.130
Ishida Mitsunari sent messengers to various daimyo in the name of the Toyotomi clan,

01:48.130 --> 01:51.300
telling them to raise armies.

01:51.300 --> 01:56.390
At the same time, beings seeking to end the period of turbulence

01:56.390 --> 02:00.270
and build a kingdom to last a thousand years

02:00.270 --> 02:04.520
were about to awaken from a thousand-year sleep.

02:04.520 --> 02:06.520
And then...

02:06.520 --> 02:10.280
On the fifteenth day of the ninth month, at Sekigahara,

02:10.280 --> 02:12.740
the Eastern Army of Tokugawa Ieyasu clashed with

02:12.740 --> 02:17.870
the Western Army of the Toyotomi clan and Ishida Mitsunari.

02:17.870 --> 02:21.330
As a result of the performance of Kobayakawa Hideaki's troops,

02:21.330 --> 02:27.250
the Western Army of the Toyotomi clan and
Ishida Mitsunari achieved a sweeping victory,

02:27.250 --> 02:33.510
bringing what should have been
three hundred years of peace to the world.

02:34.340 --> 02:39.390
You should all be quite familiar with this story...

02:47.320 --> 02:53.320
I am Ieyasu Tokugawa, the one who was
supposed to be the shogun of Japan!

02:53.520 --> 02:57.310
My <i>handle name</i> is Ryogen!
Pleased to meet you!

02:57.480 --> 03:01.800
In fact, according to Yasha,
<i>"handle name"</i> is <i>"nickname".</i>

03:01.960 --> 03:03.630
But that doesn't matter...

03:03.800 --> 03:08.510
I rarely see my third son, Hidetada Tokugawa.

03:08.960 --> 03:14.160
This fool tried to contact Musashi secretly.

03:14.840 --> 03:20.320
Hidetada, this total moron,
asked Musashi to kill me.

03:20.480 --> 03:22.440
What's the world coming to?

03:22.600 --> 03:24.190
Dad is sad!

03:24.400 --> 03:26.670
My little son doesn't call me <i>papa</i> anymore!

03:26.960 --> 03:33.790
I ordered Yasha to put into execution
a plan to kidnap Princess Kaguya.

03:33.960 --> 03:36.370
But Musashi got in our way!

03:37.800 --> 03:40.710
Musashi, come here for a spanking!

03:47.040 --> 03:49.920
Sorceress of the Moon

03:58.340 --> 03:59.930
That's the princess!

04:01.760 --> 04:03.060
Who are you?

04:03.720 --> 04:06.520
The master of Sumpu Castle,
Hidetada Tokugawa.

04:07.600 --> 04:09.690
Are you the son of Lord leyasu?

04:11.230 --> 04:12.690
Yes, I am his son.

04:12.940 --> 04:14.280
What happened...

04:15.490 --> 04:16.910
...to leyasu Tokugawa?

04:17.450 --> 04:19.410
You know it perfectly well!

04:20.200 --> 04:22.070
So he's still...

04:24.120 --> 04:26.070
...under the influence of the ayakashi.

04:29.710 --> 04:34.710
It's your fault my father
has become a monster!

04:35.420 --> 04:36.760
It's your fault!

04:37.920 --> 04:39.380
What do you mean?

04:40.050 --> 04:42.930
Hasn't that scoundrel leyasu
simply allied himself...

04:43.100 --> 04:45.180
...with an ayakashi called Yasha?

04:46.180 --> 04:51.520
In exchange for the Toyotomi's
ruin and power for himself,

04:52.480 --> 04:56.530
my father agreed to sell his
soul and become an ayakashi.

05:00.820 --> 05:03.070
I don't get it at all.

05:03.240 --> 05:06.870
What's the link between the
shogunate and the this princess?

05:07.290 --> 05:09.580
I just don't get it.

05:10.460 --> 05:14.670
According to Yasha, the reason the
army of the west won at Sekigahara,

05:14.840 --> 05:22.180
and Toyotomi seized power, is because
Lord Hideyoshi adopted Kaguya.

05:36.150 --> 05:40.700
According to recorded history, the eastern
army is supposed to win at Sekigahara.

05:40.860 --> 05:44.470
leyasu Tokugawa is the one
who becomes shogun...

05:44.950 --> 05:49.410
...and establishes the
Tokugawa shogunate in Edo.

05:51.870 --> 05:54.380
You already told me that.

05:55.080 --> 06:00.970
I understand you telling me
all of that to please me,

06:01.090 --> 06:04.140
but can we go back to talking
about more serious things?

06:04.300 --> 06:07.050
That sounds so absurd it's not even humorous.

06:07.640 --> 06:10.680
You don't really believe me.

06:11.230 --> 06:12.480
Of course not!

06:13.230 --> 06:15.640
It's only natural for my
father to be skeptical.

06:15.690 --> 06:17.570
Your name is Yasha, correct?

06:17.730 --> 06:23.240
I don't know what your plan is,
but spare us from that nonsense.

06:25.740 --> 06:31.120
If you want me to believe
your hogwash, bring me proof.

06:31.950 --> 06:35.420
Proof that the eastern army
should have won at Sekigahara,

06:35.580 --> 06:37.880
that I become shogun,

06:38.040 --> 06:40.840
and that I establish the
Tokugawa shogunate.

06:41.090 --> 06:42.380
Very well.

06:42.550 --> 06:46.590
You need proof to believe me.

07:54.790 --> 07:56.210
What have you done?

07:56.790 --> 07:58.130
Father!

07:58.370 --> 07:59.690
This is...

08:01.000 --> 08:02.960
the city of Edo...

08:21.900 --> 08:23.820
An illusion?

08:24.570 --> 08:27.450
Exactly, an illusion.

08:27.990 --> 08:29.230
What?

08:29.740 --> 08:33.660
But it shows the real Edo.

08:33.950 --> 08:39.170
That is, what it would
look like under your reign.

08:40.080 --> 08:42.130
The real...

08:42.670 --> 08:44.800
...city of Edo?

08:46.090 --> 08:49.090
And the same thing
applies to this castle.

08:58.520 --> 08:59.840
The castle...

09:00.390 --> 09:02.860
Is that really the real history?

09:42.810 --> 09:45.030
Everything returned to the way it was.

09:46.020 --> 09:49.320
Yasha, how did you create this illusion?

09:50.570 --> 09:52.530
I have a device for that purpose.

09:55.530 --> 10:02.290
It has to be said, the Tokugawa
shogunate will last 300 years.

10:03.290 --> 10:04.630
300 years?

10:04.960 --> 10:10.420
It is almost eternity.
Lord leyasu...

10:10.590 --> 10:17.010
you'd have offered peace for the people of the Land of the Rising Sun.

10:17.640 --> 10:21.270
Peace? For 300 years?

10:21.680 --> 10:28.570
Am I the one who should have succeeded
where Nobunaga and Hideyoshi failed?

10:29.530 --> 10:30.990
Am I?

10:36.320 --> 10:37.700
Father.

10:38.700 --> 10:43.250
Of course, you would have become
the second shogun, Lord Hidetada.

10:44.120 --> 10:46.580
I would have become the second shogun?

10:47.540 --> 10:49.840
I beg of you! Tell me!

10:50.000 --> 10:52.920
Why did the course of history change?

10:53.550 --> 10:56.590
Why did our army lose in Sekigahara?

10:56.760 --> 11:00.640
Why did the Toyotomi
establish shogunate instead?

11:01.140 --> 11:02.890
It's simple.

11:03.060 --> 11:07.270
Because this person is under
the protection of the Toyotomi.

11:08.110 --> 11:10.900
This person?
Who are you talking about?

11:15.070 --> 11:17.110
Princess Kaguya.

11:27.040 --> 11:30.790
That's ridiculous. No offense
to Princess Kaguya but,

11:31.250 --> 11:37.970
she alone could not have changed
the outcome of this great war.

11:39.010 --> 11:41.510
I thought the same thing.

11:42.100 --> 11:44.430
I'd had enough of that nonsense.

11:45.020 --> 11:48.560
But that scoundrel leyasu believed it.

11:56.450 --> 11:57.700
Kaguya?

11:57.820 --> 12:02.700
The girl Lord Hideyoshi adopted?

12:03.120 --> 12:04.390
Yes.

12:04.950 --> 12:06.290
I don't understand.

12:06.790 --> 12:09.880
How did she singlehandedly change history?

12:11.340 --> 12:16.170
Ever since Hideyoshi
has adopted Kaguya,

12:16.510 --> 12:20.340
good fortune has
followed the Toyotomi.

12:21.430 --> 12:27.730
Things that should not be
happening in history started to happen.

12:29.190 --> 12:34.730
Did you know that,
in reality, the Keicho War...

12:35.070 --> 12:38.700
should have ended with the
defeat of the Japanese army,

12:38.860 --> 12:40.700
Lord leyasu.

12:44.080 --> 12:45.430
How?

12:45.660 --> 12:47.080
Is that true?

12:48.370 --> 12:53.130
The invasion of Korea was
major blunder by Hideyoshi.

12:53.630 --> 12:56.760
You should know that
better than anyone else.

12:57.510 --> 13:01.720
True, I was the only one who opposed it.

13:02.260 --> 13:05.720
Yet, we ended up winning in Korea,

13:05.890 --> 13:11.480
and I became the least
powerful of the Five Elders.

13:12.230 --> 13:15.520
If the Japanese army
won the Keicho war,

13:15.690 --> 13:22.490
and the western army was
victorious at Sekigahara,

13:23.320 --> 13:26.950
it's entirely due to Kaguya's
supernatural powers.

13:27.790 --> 13:29.150
Supernatural powers?

13:31.330 --> 13:34.790
Would Princess Kaguya
be someone special, then?

13:35.590 --> 13:38.460
Princess Kaguya is a sorceress of the Moon.

13:40.090 --> 13:41.840
A sorceress of the Moon?

13:44.140 --> 13:46.930
Sorceress of the Moon?
What in the world?

13:48.770 --> 13:51.410
Like <i>The Tale of the Bamboo Cutter</i> fairy tale?

13:52.230 --> 13:54.140
You came from the Moon?

13:54.770 --> 13:58.070
If I did, what would you do, Musashi?

13:58.780 --> 14:00.610
Nothing in particular.

14:00.780 --> 14:03.660
I'll just call you "bragging princess".

14:05.950 --> 14:12.040
But I don't think that scoundrel leyasu
was so naive as to believe this nonsense.

14:12.580 --> 14:14.290
He's done more than that.

14:14.460 --> 14:20.010
Because of you, my father
sold his soul to the ayakashi!

14:25.970 --> 14:28.260
Please drink it.

14:28.470 --> 14:30.140
Is it really true?

14:30.350 --> 14:37.110
If I drink it, will I receive the blood
that will allow me to marry Kaguya?

14:37.860 --> 14:43.070
History will go back to normal and I,
instead of Toyotomi, will establish...

14:43.740 --> 14:47.530
...a 300 year shogunate
that will bring on peace?

14:48.160 --> 14:49.490
Exactly.

14:50.540 --> 14:58.500
To marry Kaguya, the sorceress of the
Moon, you cannot remain human.

14:59.500 --> 15:05.300
To do this, it is necessary to
sublimate the human soul.

15:12.350 --> 15:13.430
Father!

15:14.440 --> 15:16.440
Don't do it, please!
Father!

15:17.190 --> 15:22.860
Hidetada, don't get in my way,
I'll do anything for the Rising Sun,

15:23.070 --> 15:32.700
for you, my son, for my grandchildren, may the
Tokugawa reign over the country for eternity!

15:34.370 --> 15:35.540
Father!

15:45.130 --> 15:46.220
Hang in there!

15:47.510 --> 15:49.180
You scoundrel, you tricked him!

15:52.010 --> 15:53.520
Did you poison him?

15:59.310 --> 16:01.060
Are you not human?

16:01.690 --> 16:03.530
Don't tell me you're an ayakashi?

16:04.150 --> 16:06.820
If I was, what would you do?

16:06.990 --> 16:11.700
Human strength is not enough to
bring down the Toyotomi shogunate.

16:11.870 --> 16:16.460
That is why we, a hundred
times stronger than men,

16:16.620 --> 16:20.290
will give you a helping hand.

16:20.880 --> 16:22.380
Don't mess with me!

16:22.790 --> 16:26.920
The Tokugawa will not stoop so
low as to ask ayakashi for help!

16:27.670 --> 16:31.930
Look at your father and
you will change your mind.

16:32.300 --> 16:33.580
What?

16:41.520 --> 16:42.770
Father!

16:54.450 --> 16:57.410
Father!
What did you do to my father?

16:58.330 --> 17:03.670
I will reborn him into an
ayakashi with immense power.

17:03.840 --> 17:06.420
In order to marry Kaguya...

17:06.590 --> 17:10.340
...ayakashi power is essential.

17:14.300 --> 17:16.350
What incredible power!

17:17.220 --> 17:19.730
I feel 30 years younger!

17:20.100 --> 17:23.980
But I'm really hungry.

17:36.870 --> 17:38.330
Why are you running away?

17:38.500 --> 17:40.790
It's me, leyasu!

17:43.380 --> 17:44.590
Monster!

17:44.710 --> 17:46.380
How rude!

17:46.590 --> 17:48.550
Take a good look at my face!

18:00.680 --> 18:05.270
Amazing!
I feel even younger!

18:08.110 --> 18:10.940
My father, Ieyasu Tokugawa,

18:11.650 --> 18:13.860
no longer belongs in this world.

18:13.990 --> 18:20.580
All that remains in his place is a grotesque and
evil monster, the ayakashi named Ryogen.

18:21.410 --> 18:26.250
Is that why you asked
Musashi to kill your father?

18:36.470 --> 18:39.060
And I'm going to kill Kaguya!

18:39.770 --> 18:43.520
Isn't it risky to kill a Moon sorceress?

18:46.190 --> 18:51.610
Without her, my father would
have no reason to sell his soul!

18:57.490 --> 18:59.030
Are you sure?

18:59.200 --> 19:04.040
If you kill Kaguya, you can no
longer overthrow the Toyotomi.

19:04.750 --> 19:06.750
And I doubt that you can kill her.

19:07.210 --> 19:08.450
What?

19:30.730 --> 19:33.150
She is truly an acrobat.

19:33.320 --> 19:36.490
I cannot imagine her as
a sorceress of the Moon.

19:36.660 --> 19:41.370
With such a violent princess, the moon
rabbits must see all kinds of things.

19:46.710 --> 19:49.880
Musashi, do something!

19:50.630 --> 19:52.340
You've got it under control.

19:52.670 --> 19:53.880
Musashi!

20:24.830 --> 20:29.080
At this rate, we will arrive at
Osaka Castle before evening.

20:48.850 --> 20:50.520
The princess is falling!

21:24.930 --> 21:28.230
Musashi, that's enough!
Do you wanna help me now?

21:32.650 --> 21:34.060
I don't feel like it!

21:34.230 --> 21:38.490
I would for a fragile maiden,
but you are too strong!

21:38.650 --> 21:41.860
You can easily handle Hidetada.

21:48.290 --> 21:50.290
That was the cry of a fragile maiden!

21:56.670 --> 21:57.670
Ronin!

21:58.300 --> 21:59.340
Let's go!

22:10.980 --> 22:15.190
This is terrible.
Who would do this to a young maiden?

22:30.250 --> 22:32.210
You've rescued the princess.

22:33.000 --> 22:34.260
I am grateful.

22:34.710 --> 22:37.170
Are you the one who tied her up?

22:37.750 --> 22:39.590
Come on, hand me the princess.

22:40.090 --> 22:42.090
- No!
- What did you say?

22:43.170 --> 22:46.180
If you want her, you have to take her by force.

22:46.340 --> 22:48.340
You look strong, missy.

22:48.640 --> 22:51.730
Do you know who you are talking to?

22:52.310 --> 22:53.810
I don't really care.

22:54.350 --> 22:59.270
When you tie someone up like this,
you are bound to be a criminal.

23:00.110 --> 23:01.360
Amusing.

23:05.240 --> 23:08.780
Be careful, she's not a normal woman.

23:13.580 --> 23:14.920
Draw your sword.

23:15.460 --> 23:18.000
I use this!

23:20.170 --> 23:21.590
<i>Gun-dou?</i>

23:25.880 --> 23:27.050
Stop!

23:27.890 --> 23:29.970
Musashi and Yukimura, stop!

23:30.640 --> 23:31.970
Yukimura?

23:32.390 --> 23:35.940
Yukimura?
As in Sanada Yukimura?

23:38.730 --> 23:39.940
Princess Kaguya!

23:40.440 --> 23:41.870
What are you doing here?

23:43.740 --> 23:45.740
It can't be, Princess Yume?

24:00.250 --> 24:03.000
In my natural, unadorned style,

24:03.000 --> 24:05.840
I'll tell you these feelings of mine

24:05.840 --> 24:11.180
Together to the sky past the darkness!

24:11.180 --> 24:16.310
All we need to do is spread our wings and fly!

24:17.850 --> 24:22.980
Baby, we'll send time flowing forward just a little,

24:22.980 --> 24:29.160
and we'll embrace even the harsh gusts of wind

24:29.160 --> 24:34.490
with sympathy for pointless worries

24:34.490 --> 24:38.620
and a melody that will overcome the pain

24:41.000 --> 24:51.390
If the poison of the flower that bloomed in my cupped hands

24:51.390 --> 25:02.310
has managed to pierce through the center of my heart...

25:02.310 --> 25:05.070
In my natural, unadorned style,

25:05.070 --> 25:07.940
I'll tell you these feelings of mine,

25:07.940 --> 25:13.530
Unraveling this puzzle of the heart

25:13.530 --> 25:16.290
I'll bring out every part

25:16.290 --> 25:19.290
of your unchanging style

25:19.290 --> 25:24.590
Together to the sky past the darkness!

25:24.590 --> 25:29.760
All we need to do is spread our wings and fly!

25:30.760 --> 25:34.200
I don't care if Sanada Yukimura
is a man or a woman!

25:34.860 --> 25:39.540
I will punish those who dare
to hurt a fragile maiden!

25:39.700 --> 25:43.110
The next chapter: <i>Sanada Ten Braves</i>!
